From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bornaradusin <bornaradusin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 148/148] PC5: arcade sticks and flight sticks register through
 Windows.Gaming.Input (Wine patch 1014)

A title that enumerates an arcade stick or a flight stick through Windows.Gaming.Input could not get past its controller setup: the dll never registered either class, so RoGetActivationFactory failed and the title gave up before the pad it would have used. The two classes now register like RacingWheel, so the call succeeds and an empty collection comes back instead of a failure.
---
